# ...but static product assets MUST ship. The globs above are meant for test
# screenshots (those dirs are already ignored wholesale). They silently kept
# frontend/public/kolabolab-logo.png out of the repo, so the navbar shipped
# pointing at an asset that did not exist.
!frontend/public/**/*.png
!frontend/public/**/*.jpg
!frontend/public/**/*.jpeg
!frontend/public/*.png
!frontend/public/*.jpg
!frontend/public/*.jpeg
coverage/
.nyc_output/
junit.xml
test-output/

